1
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:03,260
READING

2
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:04,820
COME AND EAT HERE

3
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:05,680
1.

4
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:10,820
VANG PUNG SAT IN HIS EMPTY RESTAURANT, FEELING VERY FRUSTRATED.

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,820
It had been a very strange morning.

6
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:25,720
Then by lunchtime they would all be sold.

7
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:29,260
By now his restaurant ought to be full of people.

8
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:30,520
But not today!

9
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,060
Why was that?

10
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:37,920
He thought of his mutton, beef and bacon cooked in the hottest,

11
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:38,780
finest oil.

12
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:43,740
His cola was sugary and cold, and his ice cream was made of milk,

13
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:45,740
cream and delicious fruit.

14
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:49,060
Nothing could be better," he thought.

15
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:54,900
Hello, Lao Li," he called.

16
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:00,700
What was the matter?

17
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,460
Tired of all that fat?

18
00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:18,100
Want to lose weight?

19
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:25,870
Make yourself thin again!

20
00:01:30,980 --> 00:01:31,960
It was full of people.

21
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:35,420
The hostess, a very thin lady, came forward.

22
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:37,100
Welcome," she said.

23
00:01:47,740 --> 00:01:50,060
There were few choices of food and drink on it:

24
00:01:50,060 --> 00:01:53,120
just rice, raw vegetables served in vinegar,

25
00:01:53,580 --> 00:01:54,540
fruit and water.

26
00:02:03,220 --> 00:02:04,720
He could not believe his eyes.

27
00:02:05,260 --> 00:02:07,600
He threw down the menu and hurried outside.

28
00:02:09,020 --> 00:02:11,280
On his way home he thought about his own menu.

29
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:13,220
Did it make people fat?

30
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:16,660
Perhaps he should go to the library and find out.

31
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,780
He had better do some research!

32
00:02:44,100 --> 00:02:46,080
They would become tired very quickly.

33
00:02:51,100 --> 00:02:54,820
Perhaps with a discount and a new sign he could win his customers back.

34
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:59,460
So he wrote: Want to feel fit and energetic?

35
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,380
Come and eat here!

36
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:02,540
Discounts today!

37
00:03:03,300 --> 00:03:05,460
Our food gives you energy all day!

38
00:03:06,980 --> 00:03:10,020
The competition between the two restaurants was on!
